","type":"series","name":"The Returned (Les revenants) 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLVNlY3JldC1DaXJjbGUtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTEtMjAxMiUyOS03MjBwLw","type":"series","name":"The Secret Circle 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9Uby10aGUtQmVhdXRpZnVsLVlvdS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMi0lMjkv","type":"series","name":"To the Beautiful You","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/kltutuHuFMzvQ3LWbDFcOAebC12.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qPzBRXX8PhR1wykOJrmM1mLg7rf.jpg","description":"Goo Jae-hee lives in the United States and one day sees a track and field competition on TV, and becomes attracted to one of the high jump competitors, Kang Tae-joon. She begins to idolize the young athlete and eventually transfers to Korea to attend the same school that Tae-joon attends after he suffers an accident that could potentially end his career. There is a catch, however: Tae-joon attends an all-boys high school and Jae-hee must disguise herself as a boy to enter.","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["Korean"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVmVlcC0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMi0lMjktNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"Veep 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvV2VlZHMtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMDUtMjAxMiUyOS03MjBwLw","type":"series","name":"Weeds 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvV29ybGQtV2l0aG91dC1FbmQtJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMiUyOS03MjBwLw","type":"series","name":"World Without End (TV Mini Series 2012) 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvMiUyMEJyb2tlJTIwR2lybHMlMjAlMjgyMDExJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"2 Broke Girls","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wW1SDEoZ6pDfnSkVQuXwOo8ICep.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u04AvxFIDgL9JSd9xoVNK3BoBEd.jpg","description":"Comedy about the unlikely friendship that develops between two very different young women who meet waitressing at a diner in trendy Williamsburg, Brooklyn, and form a bond over one day owning their own successful cupcake business. Only one thing stands in their way – they’re broke.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQnJlYWtvdXQlMjBLaW5ncyUyMCUyMCUyODIwMTElMjkv","type":"series","name":"Breakout Kings","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/yAAuZlwVnAKEquHbie1LD4EPK0B.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yA6CFDqNsh0Vb2Wjgm4CLtbrYqy.jpg","description":"Driven by the fact that there are few things more dangerous than a prisoner who has just escaped, and tired of following protocol and resorting to outdated methods of law enforcement, veteran U.S. Marshals Charlie Duchamp and Ray Zancanelli are taking an unorthodox approach to their work: using former fugitives to catch fugitives.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvSG9tZWxhbmQlMjAlMjgyMDExJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Homeland","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/6GAvS2e6VIRsms9FpVt33PsCoEW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/391ixi0wVbFtFLQnOy8ZncWv2io.jpg","description":"CIA officer Carrie Mathison is tops in her field despite being bipolar, which makes her volatile and unpredictable. With the help of her long-time mentor Saul Berenson, Carrie fearlessly risks everything, including her personal well-being and even sanity, at every turn.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9NZS1Ub28lMkMtRmxvd2VyJTIxLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDExJTI5LTcyMHAv","type":"series","name":"Me Too, Flower! 720p","description":"Folder: Korean","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["Korean"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWlsZHJlZC1QaWVyY2UtJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMSUyOS03MjBwLw","type":"series","name":"Mildred Pierce (TV Mini Series 2011) 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTmV3LUdpcmwtJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTEtJTI5LTcyMHAv","type":"series","name":"New Girl 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvT25jZS1VcG9uLWEtVGltZS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMS0lMjktNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"Once Upon a Time 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGVyc29uLW9mLWludGVyZXN0LSUyODIwMTEtJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Person of interest","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/f8aIvYk5h7Z8EP3dinCmVgQFYow.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/efeMgQn6iRALsOqDa2cqlf6Pw5O.jpg","description":"John Reese, former CIA paramilitary operative, is presumed dead and teams up with reclusive billionaire Finch to prevent violent crimes in New York City by initiating their own type of justice. With the special training that Reese has had in Covert Operations and Finch's genius software inventing mind, the two are a perfect match for the job that they have to complete. With the help of surveillance equipment, they work \"outside the law\" and get the right criminal behind bars. ","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUG9kLXByaWtyaXRpZS0lMjhVbmRlcmNvdmVyJTI5LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDExLSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Pod prikritie (Undercover)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/evIjfFZrqGW9gUkQr4Lh3lEDg5p.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k0ORSGA1WfN6iOvXcJDstFWm5GU.jpg","description":"Just an ordinary boy from the Sofia suburbs becomes the first bulgarian undercover cop. Forced by his father when he was young to lie and cheat, Martin becomes the perfect liar. That skill, and also the hatred of the 'underworld' makes him the perfect match for a dangerous mission - to infiltrate the crime organisation of a rich and powerful businessman. While infiltrating and living in fear of being uncovered, Martin falls in love with the most inappropriate woman - Djaro's girlfriend, Suni. Just when he gains the trust of the mobsters, it appears that the real enemy is in the police. Martin is alone against all, facing difficult decisions.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmV2ZW5nZS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMS0lMjktNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"Revenge 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9TZWNyZXQtR2FyZGVuLVRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDEwLTIwMTEv","type":"series","name":"Secret Garden TV Series 2010","description":"Folder: Korean","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["Korean"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvU2hhbWVsZXNzJTIwJTI4MjAxMSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Shameless","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/Yi3WVT6hOkPahOwwvmLmif1jhs.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3w1iNNuMiFVDDUyycJoSAFksjc7.jpg","description":"Chicagoan Frank Gallagher is the proud single dad of six smart, industrious, independent kids, who without him would be... perhaps better off. When Frank's not at the bar spending what little money they have, he's passed out on the floor. But the kids have found ways to grow up in spite of him. They may not be like any family you know, but they make no apologies for being exactly who they are.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvU3BhcnRhY3VzLUdvZHMtb2YtdGhlLUFyZW5hLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktU2VyaWVzLTIwMTElMjktNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"Spartacus Gods of the Arena (TV Mini Series 2011) 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvU3VpdHMtJTI4MjAxMS0lMjkv","type":"series","name":"Suits","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vQiryp6LioFxQThywxbC6TuoDjy.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/or0E36KfzJYZwqXeiCfm1JgepKF.jpg","description":"While running from a drug deal gone bad, Mike Ross, a brilliant young college-dropout, slips into a job interview with one of New York City's best legal closers, Harvey Specter. Tired of cookie-cutter law school grads, Harvey takes a gamble by hiring Mike on the spot after he recognizes his raw talent and photographic memory.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGVycmEtTm92YS0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMS0lMjkv","type":"series","name":"Terra Nova","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/y8dFONeUSXhMHiFecqFoaGI7S6y.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3kz0Hp1sO7JnHFX8BzTokdxTuwY.jpg","description":"In the year 2149, the world is dying. The planet is overdeveloped and overcrowded, with the majority of plant and animal life extinct. The future of mankind is in jeopardy, and its only hope for survival is in the distant past. An ordinary family goes on an e